## 4.10 Technical, SEO and Accessibility Checklist

- Semantic HTML5 throughout; one `h1` per page; logical heading order.
- Unique `<title>` and meta description per page, written plainly (no em dashes). Title pattern: `Page Name | Russell & Co Pest Solutions`.
- Open Graph tags (`og:title`, `og:description`, `og:type`, `og:image`). For `og:image` generate a simple 1200x630 black-and-white image from the logo lockup and save it in `/images`.
- Favicon and `apple-touch-icon` made from the real logo lettering.
- **JSON-LD** on the home page: `PestControlService` (or `LocalBusiness`) with `name`, `telephone`, `email`, `areaServed` set to South East Queensland, `sameAs` with only verified social URLs, and `identifier` for the licence. Do NOT include `address`, `openingHours`, or `aggregateRating`.
- `loading="lazy"` on below-the-fold images; `<picture>` with `.webp` where raster images exist.
- Alt text on every image; `aria-label` on every icon-only control.
- Visible focus outlines never suppressed.
- WCAG AA contrast checked on the actual palette, including `--ash` text.
- `tel:` and `sms:` links use international format `+61433355980`.
- `lang="en-AU"` on every `<html>`.
- No console errors, no broken links, no unused CSS at handoff.
- No tracking scripts, no cookie banner needed.

